        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4ba192f4-a19c-3e66-8d86-4a1fca294d1f",
                "word": "Gosselin",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58d63d8d-482f-3bfd-b5d5-b6487a28ed11",
                        "entry_id": "4ba192f4-a19c-3e66-8d86-4a1fca294d1f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nom de famille."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "145adb9a-68d3-438a-b323-ed138c52712f",
                                "sense_id": "58d63d8d-482f-3bfd-b5d5-b6487a28ed11",
                                "text": "« Ce n’est pas normal et ce n’est surtout pas acceptable, a écrit l’attachée de presse, Élisabeth Gosselin. Les Québécois ont le droit d’être servis et informés en français. Il s’agit d’un droit fondamental. »"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f07f711e-48e2-412b-a98d-c7f8920563f6",
                                "sense_id": "58d63d8d-482f-3bfd-b5d5-b6487a28ed11",
                                "text": "En s'inspirant du kirigami, les professeurs David Mélançon et Frédérick Gosselin du département de génie mécanique de Polytechnique Montréal ont développé un parachute qui interagit efficacement avec l'air pendant une chute libre."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                "word": "gosselin",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cae6a066-bcbf-4036-a16a-351605e924fe",
                        "entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "gosselins"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e9f0d884-e6cf-445b-9261-944fcd3ba65b",
                        "entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "gosseline"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                        "entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Garçon, enfant, adolescent ou jeune homme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6f8c789-0f14-4fc4-bbee-2749bc37d446",
                                "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                                "text": "Ainsi, nous avons été arrachés de nos lits et de nos doux foyers, parce qu’un gosselin (petit enfant) s’est avisé de verver (pleurer). Par l’âme de ma grand’mère, c’est trop fort !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f0770c6-0297-48e9-a819-e6d9683c6285",
                                "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                                "text": "Un reluis en jaspinant avec un gosselin, il me jacte que dans un luisant ou deux il allait rappliquer à la niche."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bda25d7-d6ec-4068-9293-e3e74802cc93",
                                "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                                "text": "— Oui, je sais, on passe chercher le moineau. Il est moins cinq. Il va être plutôt fier, le gosselin, le petit chenapan, oui, plutôt fier de quitter l’école en voiture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "500d62b9-7192-40b1-96f1-d3f394e360e2",
                                "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                                "text": "Il gambade dans l’escadrin, le gosselin, tant trouillardé qu’il a même pas pris l’ascenseur. Des moments, la vie mécanique, bien que simplifiante, paraît trop compliquée."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a89b64ab-d5d6-48d3-ae9a-9acaf9d4c44c",
                                "sense_id": "12dcf838-295d-3025-8fe9-f496a69448f6",
                                "text": "Pour l'instant, le gosselin devait attendre Trois-Clous allongé sur une vieille tombe du cimetière mérovingien, dissimulé dans les herbes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be2944ef-a1c5-3838-b780-a8658eece0f3",
                        "entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Veau ou agneau mort-né."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "088ba979-3812-4257-8018-e2d6fa1e12c7",
                                "sense_id": "be2944ef-a1c5-3838-b780-a8658eece0f3",
                                "text": "→ Voir exemples dans gosselins."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31c881f6-eca7-4419-9bc4-278be3f4a6d7",
                        "source_entry_id": "513c0d88-2de1-334b-8a1c-98632d337e8e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lad",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lad",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A boy or young man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05aceb20-cc18-4a90-89d2-4bc35c05241f",
                                                "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                                "text": "How great is that danger, to which poor lads are now exposed, when placed on shipboard to learn the art of sailing! Five lads, training up for the seas, were now on board this ship; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87f94a52-3fed-4dbe-a94f-7646eb99c8f3",
                                                "sense_id": "15412081-6183-3643-a6f3-647ec596d5cc",
                                                "text": "The lad, his son, had obtained a Jew's-harp, and learned to play upon it the profane airs of \"Yankee Doodle,\" \"Hail Columbia,\" \"St. Patrick's Day,\" and \"Auld Lang Syne.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hedonistic or irresponsible young man; A Jack the lad."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "British"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d13c2e32-33c8-498c-a972-d4ccec1dd543",
                                                "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                                "text": "I think he reckons he’s a bit of a lad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7ea2cf2-6e39-49c5-9f0a-9d36dcb08c9e",
                                                "sense_id": "82ed9bd0-fa94-3340-9aaf-ac6335c84158",
                                                "text": "Last night I was out drinking with the lads."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c81b5950-9aac-379a-ab47-ff0e34ee4314",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A familiar term of address for a young man."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4aafc6e7-c175-46a7-9372-b3f42044f8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "c81b5950-9aac-379a-ab47-ff0e34ee4314",
                                                "text": "Come here, lad, and help me shift these boxes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fe8ccad6-b103-36c8-83a6-ed0b15309ad6",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A groom who works with horses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The penis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Ireland",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e255a8ed-1308-402b-b541-b296578968b5",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "— The lad stood to attention anyhow, he said with a sigh. She's a gamey mare and no mistake."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf338b52-ef45-4c74-ad12-96e9eddadf5d",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "Mrs Glynn: Oh but there's this great bit in it. You see, there was this girl, but then you find out it's not a girl but a man!\nMrs Sheridan: And he got his lad out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a115054-c916-4203-a27c-207d95e4effd",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "And he loaded the chariot with clods and boulders and cobbles that he fired at anyone who came to stare at him and jeer him, stark naked as he was, with his long lad and his acorns dangling down through the floor of the chariot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47584e51-edef-4b07-8694-8a2d6ee2ff72",
                                                "sense_id": "d7fd3697-ffaf-35c0-8560-2e925e3667dd",
                                                "text": "Just thinking about how she would look without her clothes made his lad twitch with anticipation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ad3e845-950f-3243-8312-0fd9d42a8eda",
                                        "entry_id": "a6874a97-36e7-390d-a25d-761e4fa0954c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A scammer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Internet"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aebfd279-e50a-4136-9a48-52f2255075fb",
                                                "sense_id": "7ad3e845-950f-3243-8312-0fd9d42a8eda",
                                                "text": "[...] regardless whether you feel the lads may deserve to be subjected to those types of images."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
